    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">State University of New York</h2>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Applying For Paid Family Leave</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(Form PFL-1) Instructions</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">To Use Paid Family Leave To:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Bond with a newborn, a newly adopted or fostered child</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Complete Form PFL-1, Part A</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Provide PFL-1 to employer</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Employer completes PFL-1, Part B and returns to you within 3 days</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Complete Form PFL-2</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
